oin us again this year, thankful for all his support \u2764\ufe0f\ud83d\ude4f<br \/>\nWear Hope. Give Healing. Support the Palestine Children\u2019s Relief Fund \u2728<br \/>\nCelebrate love &amp; Palestinian culture! \u2764\ufe0f\ud83c\uddf5\ud83c\uddf8<\/p>\n<p>Delicious bites \ud83e\udd59<br \/>\nMusic that will make you want to dance \ud83d\udc83<br \/>\nArtisan Market Scene \ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p><\/blockquote>\n<!-- AddThis Advanced Settings generic via filter on the_content --><!-- AddThis Share Buttons generic via filter on the_content -->","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The 47th annual Palestine Day Festival takes place in Redwood City with traditional Palestinian cuisine, music and dancing, and an artisan market. The event also shares information about PAC\u2019s cultural-preservation work and support for the Palestine Children\u2019s Relief Fund.<br \/>\nOriginal Event Description:<br \/>\nPalestine Day Festival<br \/>\nSYywo1DaroagVULxmBNVg<br \/>\nSaturday, Oct 17, &#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":1641014,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[4,13968,94,9,13549,99],"tags":[],"region":[],"class_list":["post-1641015","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-top-pick","category-community","category-eating-drinking","category-fairs-festivals","category-in-person","category-shopping-fashion","internal-priority-top-pick-3","source-ai-import"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/sf.funcheap.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/1641015","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/sf.funcheap.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/sf.funcheap.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/sf.funcheap.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[